      "id": "claim_c8bff3a5a44d4192bb2487e6843f3602",
      "statement": "The Bifrost CLI checks the server's explicit contract version before ordinary commands and stops on a mismatch; a build-version difference with a matching contract is only a notice, and the update command bypasses the gate so an incompatible CLI can recover.",
